{
  "date": "2025-12-31",
  "period_start": "2025-12-01",
  "period_end": "2025-12-31",
  "title": "More ways to make images and video",
  "summary": "Generation gained more models and controls, while the site, API, and Pollen tools became easier to use together.\n\nVeo and Seedance video generation gained chat controls, image inputs, and frame-based options. Seedream, GPT Image, and Z-Image expanded image generation and editing; Z-Image became the default image model.\n\nThe rebuilt Hello playground became the pollinations.ai frontend, bringing generation, docs, themes, and a consolidated community app directory together. Play later gained reference-image editing and a feed of completed images.\n\nEnter added usage exports, model-restricted keys, and an authorization flow for third-party apps. Balance tracking now separates tier grants from purchased packs, with both shown in the dashboard.\n\nGPT-5.2, Gemini 3 Flash, and DeepSeek V3.2 joined or took over model routes. Gemini gained built-in tools and video input, while compatibility fixes addressed thinking settings, tool schemas, and streaming text.",
  "pr_count": 266,
